    "detailed_description": "Step into a frosty adventure with Snow Fortress 2, the thrilling sequel to the beloved VR snow fort building experience. Explore expansive winter landscapes, design your own icy fortress, and engage in exhilarating snowball fights against a horde of snowmen. Playable on Meta Quest, SteamVR, and Pico platforms, Snow Fortress 2 offers a winter wonderland of fun, activity, and creativity for all ages.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive winter environments: Explore a winter forest and a charming village<br></li><li>Creative fort building: Construct your fortress with blocks of snow and ice<br></li><li>Exciting combat: Fight off an army of snowmen with improved mechanics and a variety of weapons<br></li><li>Multiplayer modes: Team up in co-op mode or challenge friends in PvP matches<br></li><li>Family-friendly and physically active: Duck, throw, and strategize in this fun-filled VR experience</li></ul>",
